$INCLUDE general.header

$PROBLEM IMATINIB Model Predictions Study PK-PD GIST. A priori prediction.

$INPUT ID TIME EVID AMT CMT SS II DV age bodyweight CLcr temperature sex RATE

$INCLUDE general.dataimport

